    "body": "Version 2.0 Released!!\r\n\r\nThis update has a lot of nice features. The font is now correct! The entire UI is much more faithful to the original. I also fixed some bugs with the calculator part of the... calculator. \r\n\r\nMy warning still stands, but things are a little better now \r\n\r\n### Warning\r\n**This was a fun pet project inspired by a [tweet](https://twitter.com/BasicAppleGuy/status/1482524358958469124). While it is a faithful *visual* recreation of the dashboard calculator, it is probably not robust enough to be a calculator program. I make no guarantee that will produce 100% accurate caclulator results so please don't use this app for payroll or your taxes or to try and land a space shuttle, don't use it for homework, or your job, or even to calculate tip without double checking on a different calculator**"
  },
